<title>GERMANY: Mobilcom Q1 profits above expectations.</title>
<headline>Mobilcom Q1 profits above expectations.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>German mobile phone service group MobilCom AG said on Wednesday it made a profit on ordinary activities of 5.4 million marks for the first quarter of the year, more than double what it was expecting.</p>
<p>The group said that while it was not possible to extrapolate year earnings directly from the high first quarter results, it nonetheless said that full-year earnings would be above current expectations.</p>
</text>
